    "body": "I also feel like this has been discussed on the spec side before, although I can't find an issue in this repo or anything on the whatwg mailing list. In any case, @mounirlamouri has been involved, and Chromium was changed in https://crbug.com/350303.\r\n\r\nImplementing the spec'd behavior was hard for the longest time because there was no internal hook with the right timing. There is now, but I'm not surprised that it's still not consistent cross-browser.\r\n\r\nTests for this are at https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements/user-interface/muted.html and while Chromium passes I don't think the web compat constraints here are very strong, so if there's some other model which is easier to support in Gecko and WebKit maybe we should change it.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
