    "updated_at": "2026-04-09T08:49:04Z",
    "body": "The current status in Blink is that the content attribute is used in two places beyond generated bindings for `defaultMuted`:\n- [when the attribute is set by the parser](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/media/html_media_element.cc;l=843-846;drc=15be50893f87a32a6a12adea5051b701414e932f)\n- [when cloning](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/media/html_media_element.cc;l=862-872;drc=15be50893f87a32a6a12adea5051b701414e932f)\n\nSpecifying this would require \"attribute modification reason\" for the first and custom cloning steps for the second.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
